@startuml use_case_diagram

title Calculator System - Use Cases by Layer

left to right direction

' Actors
actor User as user
actor System as system

package "Calculation Engine Layer" #FFE6E6 {
    usecase "Perform Arithmetic" as calc_arithmetic
    usecase "Validate Operation" as calc_validate
    usecase "Handle Errors" as calc_error
}

package "Memory/History Layer" #E6FFE6 {
    usecase "Store Entry" as mem_store
    usecase "Retrieve History" as mem_retrieve
    usecase "Filter Entries" as mem_filter
    usecase "Export History" as mem_export
    usecase "Import History" as mem_import
    usecase "Get Statistics" as mem_stats
}

package "Interface Layer" #FFF9E6 {
    usecase "Coordinate Layers" as iface_coord
    usecase "Capture Execution Time" as iface_timing
    usecase "Provide Unified API" as iface_api
}

package "User Interaction (CLI)" #FFFFCC {
    usecase "Interactive Menu" as cli_interactive
    usecase "One-Shot Calculate" as cli_oneshot
    usecase "View History" as cli_history
    usecase "Export/Import Data" as cli_import_export
    usecase "View Statistics" as cli_statistics
}

' Relationships
user --> cli_interactive: use
user --> cli_oneshot: use
user --> cli_history: use
user --> cli_import_export: use
user --> cli_statistics: use

cli_interactive --> iface_coord: delegates to
cli_oneshot --> iface_coord: delegates to
cli_history --> mem_retrieve: queries
cli_import_export --> mem_export: uses
cli_import_export --> mem_import: uses
cli_statistics --> mem_stats: uses

iface_coord --> calc_arithmetic: calls
iface_coord --> calc_validate: calls
iface_coord --> mem_store: calls
iface_timing --> calc_arithmetic: measures

calc_arithmetic --> calc_error: may raise
calc_error --> mem_store: captured as ErrorEntry

mem_filter ..> mem_retrieve: filters result of
mem_stats ..> mem_retrieve: computes from

system --> mem_export: external tool
mem_export --> system: produces file
system --> mem_import: external source
mem_import --> system: reads file

note right of calc_arithmetic
  **Calculation Engine:**
  Pure arithmetic operations
  No state/history
  Stateless functions
end note

note right of mem_store
  **Memory/History:**
  All operations logged
  Supports filtering
  Enables statistics
end note

note right of iface_coord
  **Interface Layer:**
  Glue between Cal & Mem
  Transparent coordination
end note

note right of cli_interactive
  **User Interaction:**
  Menu-driven or CLI args
  Human-friendly output
end note

@enduml
